@startuml
title UC3 - Issue Referral (Success Scenario)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Healthcare Professional" as HP
participant "Appointment Tracking System" as System

HP -> System: searchPatient(searchCriteria)
System --> HP: patientInformation

HP -> System: issueReferral(\npatientID, referringProfessionalID,\nrequestedSpecialtyID, requestedProfessionalID,\nclinicalReason, priority)

System --> HP: referralID, referralStatus,\nreferralConfirmation

note right of System
  A Referral instance is created
  and associated with the patient
  and referring professional.

  The requested specialty and/or
  professional is recorded.
end note

@enduml
